# No agent contributor

Never add Cursor, an agent, or any AI identity as a contributor on this repo.

- Do not put `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or `cursoragent`, or any agent email) in commit messages.
- Do not set commit author or committer to Cursor.
- Do not add Cursor as a GitHub collaborator.
- Commits must be authored only by the human user.
- If a commit already has an agent trailer, strip it before push.
